        "Content": "Porch (5.25ft x 4.59ft) \r\nEntrance Hall (11.48ft x 8.86ft) Wooden floor, understairs storage.\r\nOffice (9.84ft x 9.84ft) With wooden floor.\r\nDining Room (13.12ft x 9.84ft) With bay, wooden floor, presses and serving hatch.\r\nSitting Room (16.40ft x 19.69ft) Into bay, wooden floor, coving, marble fireplace, wall lights.\r\nConservatory (21.33ft x 13.12ft) Tiled floor, french doors, wall lights.\r\nKitchen (11.48ft x 13.12ft) Built-in ground and eye level units, 2 double s.s. sink unit, double oven Aga.\r\nWC Toilet.\r\nUtility Room (8.53ft x 4.59ft) Shelving, plumbed.\r\nBack Hall Boiler, access to back garden.\r\nGarage (16.40ft x 9.84ft) Roller door, shelving.\r\nUpper Landing \r\nMain Bedroom (29.53ft x 9.84ft) Wooden floor, wall lights, built-in wardrobes, fireplace, separate rear entrance.\r\nDressing Room (9.84ft x 16.40ft) (Large) - Wooden floor, built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 2 (13.12ft x 9.84ft) Wooden floor, range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nShower Room Newly tiled floor and surround, w.c., w.h.b., heated towel rail, electric wet room shower.\r\nBedroom 3 (9.84ft x 9.84ft) Wooden floor, built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 4 (13.12ft x 9.84ft) Wooden floor, shelving, range of built-in wardrobes.\r\nHotpress Shelved with immersion."
